==English==
[[File:Evarcha arcuata (female), Wollenberg, Hesse, Germany - 20110429.ogv|thumb|a '''jumping spider''' jumping<br>(from 0:40 to end, last third of clip)]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[jump]]ing [[spider]]}}

# Any of very many spiders, of the [[family]] {{taxfmt|Salticidae|family}}, that [[jump]] from place to place with the aid of a [[silk]] [[tether]].

